9:/**
10: * The price of a stay: every night costs the room's nightly rate, plus the high-season surcharge on
11: * high-season nights; the rate plan then decides its own discount, or its own price altogether. Money
12: * is rounded to cents (half-even) at every step.
13: */
14:public final class PriceCalculator {
15:
16:    static final BigDecimal HIGH_SEASON_SURCHARGE = new BigDecimal("0.20");
17:
18:    public Price calculate(Room room, LocalDate checkIn, LocalDate checkOut, RatePlan ratePlan, String companyCode) {
19:        return ratePlan.price(room, checkIn, checkOut, companyCode, this);
20:    }
